[14273]="70051619\n1\tCollect crafter's lead\030Collect grey mushrooms\030Collect scrub-moss\tThe Zhélruka Dwarf Mózhek has asked you to gather crafter's lead, grey mushrooms, and scrub-moss while assisting his people in the Grey Mountains. These items may be found by defeating foes in Grey Mountains endgame instances. Different instances will yield different types of items!\n2\tReturn to Mózhek\tYou should deliver the items you collected to Mózhek in Skarháld.\n",
